@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@token = replace-with-bearer-token

### List document specifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-specifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter document specifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-specifications?search=contrato&moment=formalization&status=available
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject invalid query
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-specifications?pageSize=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
